\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tablespoon]] [[Cookbook:Wheat Germ|wheat germ]]\n* 1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Margarine|margarine]]\n* 2 tablespoons grated orange peel\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoon]] [[Cookbook:Cinnamon|cinnamon]]\n* ¼ teaspoon fresh grated [[Cookbook:Nutmeg|nutmeg]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Slice sweet potatoes about ⅛ inch thick and spread evenly in an 8-inch square [[Cookbook:Baking Dish|baking dish]].\n# Combine orange juice, brown sugar, wheat germ, margarine, orange peel, cinnamon and nutmeg in bowl.\n# Pour liquid mixture over the sweet potatoes.\n# Cover dish with [[Cookbook:Aluminium Foil|foil]] or lid. [[Cookbook:Baking|Bake]] for 1 hour at 350°F until potatoes are tender.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using sweet potato]]\n[[Category:Recipes using nutmeg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using ground cinnamon]]\n[[Category:Southern U.S. recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes for dessert]]\n[[Category:Baking recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using orange juice]]\n\n[[Category:Recipes using brown sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using margarine]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Orange-Glazed Sweet Potatoes","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 pound sweet potatoes","sourceText":"1 pound sweet potatoes","amountText":"1 pound sweet potatoes","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"¾ cup orange juice","sourceText":"¾ cup orange juice","amountText":"¾ cup orange juice","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"½ cup firmly packed brown sugar","sourceText":"½ cup firmly packed brown sugar","amountText":"½ cup firmly packed brown sugar","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"¼ tablespoon wheat germ","sourceText":"¼ tablespoon wheat germ","amountText":"¼ tablespoon wheat germ","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-5","name":"1 tablespoon margarine","sourceText":"1 tablespoon margarine","am